            B.q("ai-m5-13", "ai-container-troubleshoot", "What is the likely cause?", listOf("The tag 2.4.0 was never pushed to the reminders repository", "The kubelet identity lacks the AcrPull role on the registry", "The nodes cannot resolve larkspur.azurecr.io through private DNS", "The node's disk is full, so the image layers cannot be written"), setOf(0), "'not found' (or 'manifest unknown') means the registry was reached and access was allowed, but there is no image under that name and tag, often a typo or a push that never happened. Sign-in problems show 401 Unauthorized or 403 Forbidden instead. Check with az acr repository show-tags, then fix the tag or push the image.",
